#. type: Title ####
#: ../../info/wxmaxima.md:360
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "File format of wxmx files"
msgstr "Formati di file"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../../info/wxmaxima.md:364
msgid "A `wxmx`-file seems to be a binary format, but one can handle it with tools, which are included in your OS. It is a zip file, one can decompress it with `unzip` (maybe rename it before, so that is recognized by the unzip program of your OS).  We do not use the compression function, just the possibility to merge several files into one file - images are already compressed and the rest is simple text (probably much smaller, than huge images, which are included)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: ../../info/wxmaxima.md:366
msgid "It does contain the following files:"
