"    explicit(\n"
"        sin(x),\n"
"        x,1,10\n"
"    )\n"
"),wxplot_size=[1600,800]$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../../info/wxmaxima.md:763
msgid "For the `plot`-commands (e.g. `wxplot2d`, `wxplot3d`) font sizes and fonts can be set using the `gnuplot_preamble` command, e.g.:"
