#. type: Fenced code block (maxima)
#: ../../info/wxmaxima.md:764
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"wxplot2d(sin(x),[x,1,10],\n"
"         [gnuplot_preamble, \"set tics font \\\"Arial, 30\\\"; set xlabel font \\\",20\\\"; set ylabel font \\\",20\\\";\"]);\n"
