#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../../info/wxmaxima.md:841
msgid "**`parenstyle=<style>`**: Sets the type of parenthesis or brackets to draw around the matrix. Supported styles are: `round` `()`, `square` `[]`, `angled` `<>`, `straight` `||`, or `none`."
